      "level": 1,
      "ordinal": 4,
      "summary": "Aframax Demurrage In February to date, demurrage assessments for Aframaxes and Panamaxes have been 2.2 and 2.7 times that of daily timecharter equivalent earnings on average. Due to crude storage, lower refinery runs and less crude production in the region, the Caribbean has become a stagnant market with each part of the supply chain waiting for the downstream link to open up some demand.",
